<title>ITALY: TABLE - Italian bank lending rose 3.7pct in June.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Italian bank lending rose 3.7pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending rose 3.7 percent year-on-year in June, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			 June 97     May 97	 June 1996</p>
<p>Total bank lending  +3.7%	+2.4%	   +2.7%</p>
<p>Lira bank lending   +4.3%	+2.8%	   +5.4%</p>
<p>Deposits		-3.2%	-2.3% (r)     +5.2%</p>
<p>Note - (r) denotes revised figure.</p>
</text>
